@title Cabinet: heat-aware Place all
@area Cabinet
# Made-up cabinet (qa/fixtures/heat-place-all.novo, built by the heat_place_all example): three 45 W drives and eight PLC modules with a 45 C limit, no device placed yet. Place all keeps the modules out of the drives' plume, says what it did, and the Place rules window has the switch. The fixture is planning values, not maker data.
open qa/fixtures/heat-place-all.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot cabinet-before
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text place all
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Heat-aware"
shot cabinet-place-all-preview
check_layout
check_blank cabinet-place-all-preview
key Enter
wait 20
shot cabinet-placed
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text place rules
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Heat-aware placement"
shot place-rules-heat-switch
check_layout
